[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17610.11, "timestamp": "04:53:30", "text": "去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17613.35, "timestamp": "04:53:33", "text": "啊。好的。好的。所以我的错误是，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17616.788, "timestamp": "04:53:36", "text": "我要进入会议了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17619.35, "timestamp": "04:53:39", "text": "听的时候，最重要的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17621.99, "timestamp": "04:53:41", "text": "听力理解就是你，你不……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17624.708, "timestamp": "04:53:44", "text": "需要跳过其余不必要的部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17628.31, "timestamp": "04:53:48", "text": "东西，只看、只听、只懂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17630.628, "timestamp": "04:53:50", "text": "这里最重要的是什么。重要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17633.35, "timestamp": "04:53:53", "text": "问题是，现在时机不对，我仍然……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17634.83, "timestamp": "04:53:54", "text": "调查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17637.83, "timestamp": "04:53:57", "text": "那个东西。我当时专注于那件事"}]